//  Same rewrite as stage 4c (3-byte FullBlock {lo, hi, data} / 2-byte BlockID,
//  ID loads LDRB -> LDRH, data loads one byte later), with a finer analysis:
//  only the accesses reachable from the call count (the compiler reuses stack
//  slots), "+N" offsets are taken into account, the data byte may be stored
//  back (STRB one byte later), the slot's address may go to
//      FullBlock::getBlock (0x100057C94), the Block-flag test 0x100057C5C,
//      BlockSource::setBlockAndData(pos, FullBlock const&, flags) (0x10079B320)
